sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant S3Gateway as API Gateway (S3Gateway)
    participant FileController
    participant FileService
    participant S3Repository
    participant AWSS3 as AWS S3

    %% Step 1: Client initiates request
    Client->>S3Gateway: POST /s3/upload<br/>File data and metadata
    S3Gateway->>FileController: Forward upload request

    %% Step 2: Controller handles the request
    FileController->>FileService: Validate request and call uploadFile(bucket, file)

    %% Step 3: Service performs upload logic
    FileService->>S3Repository: uploadFile(bucket, key, file)
    S3Repository->>AWSS3: Upload object to target bucket
    AWSS3-->>S3Repository: Confirm successful upload
    S3Repository-->>FileService: Return upload result

    %% Step 4: Return response
    FileService-->>FileController: Return upload success response
    FileController-->>S3Gateway: Format and send response
    S3Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK (File uploaded successfully)
